        ecrm:P126_employed      "warp: ivory silk no twist.  Weft: cotton: description S spun 2 ply.  Satin and velvet warp order 3-1-3.  Velvet structure, red and green.  Pile counts, warps 9.  along weft 15.  Binding weft threads: silk, super skinny white filament no twist.  Brocade structure: wholly brocaded? whole  4/1 twill.  Shots between pile 2.  Metal &amp"@en , "twist: gilt or silver (?) Z . Tightness of wrap: loosely.  Silk filament slight S twist for yellow"@en , "no twist for ivory.  Selvedges dimensions not taken.  Weft faced exposing more cotton"@en , "a tabby weave."@en , "woven silk brocade  with repeat on vertical axis with 2 minimum pattern areas.  Satin foundation structure, 4/1 satin"@en ;
